  "body": "Green box in step 11.\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#the-script-element:domparser\n\"DOMParser\" navigates directly to P&S spec (and in this version of spec id #the-domparser-interface is missing) but, in fact, should navigates to somewhere in 2.2.2 Dependencies where all refers for P&S exist now:\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#domparser\n",
